    - Narrator
    - Narrator
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - At the end of day 1, the human gives the dog a treat to help him sleep through
      the night. The dog eagerly takes the treat from the human's hand and eats it.
    - As he falls asleep, he can sense that something is not right. He curls up beside
      the human, feeling safe and protected by his presence.
    - Throughout the night, he dreams of playing outside, chasing his tennis ball
      through the green grass, unaware of the devastation that has occurred outside.
  itemsClicked: 0
